on_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line057:m0099","start":99,"end":100,"surface":"壺","kind":"person","person_id":"4z4_ujq_8yo","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line057:m0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"艾","kind":"person","person_id":"3be_236_nrw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line057:m0112","start":112,"end":116,"surface":"南頓王宗","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAACD","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line057:m0122","start":122,"end":126,"surface":"汝南王祐","kind":"person","person_id":"4la_68w_05u","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line057:m0130","start":130,"end":134,"surface":"西陽王羕","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAACC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line057:m0150","start":150,"end":151,"surface":"鳳","kind":"person","person_id":"762_5c8_663","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line057:m0167","start":167,"end":168,"surface":"鳳","kind":"person","person_id":"762_5c8_663","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":57,"last_line":57,"revision_id":2614273},"source_quote":{"witness":"j98","quote":"今遣司徒導，鎮南將軍、丹陽尹嶠，建威將軍趙胤武旅三萬，十道並進；平西將軍邃率兗州刺史遐、奮武將軍峻、奮威將軍贍精銳三萬，水陸齊勢；朕親禦六軍，左衛將軍亮，右衛將軍胤，護軍將軍詹，領軍將軍瞻，中軍將軍壺，驍騎將軍艾，驃騎將軍、南頓王宗，鎮軍將軍、汝南王祐，太宰、西陽王羕被練三千，組甲三萬，總統諸軍，討鳳之罪。罪止一人，朕不濫刑。有能殺鳳送首，封五千戶侯，賞布五千匹。","raw_start":5068,"raw_end":5251,"raw_line":57},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067","text":"近承大將軍困篤綿綿，或云已有不諱，悲怛之情，不能自勝。尋知錢鳳大嚴，欲肆奸逆，朝士忿憤，莫不扼腕。去月二十三日，得征北告，劉遐、陶瞻、蘇峻等深懷憂慮，不謀同辭。都邑大小及二宮宿衛咸懼有往年之掠，不復保其妻孥，是以聖主發赫斯之命，具如檄旨。近有嘉詔，崇兄八命，望兄獎群賢忠義之心，抑奸細不逞之計，當還武昌，盡力籓任。卒奉來告，乃承與犬羊俱下，雖當逼近，猶以罔然。兄立身率素，見信明于門宗，年逾耳順，位極人臣，仲玉、安期亦不足作佳少年，本來門戶，良可惜也！","annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067:m0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"錢鳳","kind":"person","person_id":"762_5c8_663","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067:m0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"劉遐","kind":"person","person_id":"1eg_4i2_q9u","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067:m0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"陶瞻","kind":"person","person_id":"5r7_x6g_gtf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067:m0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"蘇峻","kind":"person","person_id":"lrg_cze_g1l","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067:m0203","start":203,"end":205,"surface":"仲玉","kind":"person","person_id":"vd6_zwf_uyq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067:m0206","start":206,"end":208,"surface":"安期","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":67,"last_line":67,"revision_id":2614273},"source_quote":{"witness":"j98","quote":"近承大將軍困篤綿綿，或云已有不諱，悲怛之情，不能自勝。尋知錢鳳大嚴，欲肆奸逆，朝士忿憤，莫不扼腕。去月二十三日，得征北告，劉遐、陶瞻、蘇峻等深懷憂慮，不謀同辭。都邑大小及二宮宿衛咸懼有往年之掠，不復保其妻孥，是以聖主發赫斯之命，具如檄旨。近有嘉詔，崇兄八命，望兄獎群賢忠義之心，抑奸細不逞之計，當還武昌，盡力籓任。卒奉來告，乃承與犬羊俱下，雖當逼近，猶以罔然。兄立身率素，見信明于門宗，年逾耳順，位極人臣，仲玉、安期亦不足作佳少年，本來門戶，良可惜也！","raw_start":5649,"raw_end":5875,"raw_line":67},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line073","text":"夫福如反手，用之即是。導所統六軍，石頭萬五千人，宮內後苑二萬人，護軍屯金城六千人，劉遐已至，征北昨已濟江萬五千人。以天子之威，文武畢力，豈可當乎！事猶可追，兄早思之。大兵一奪，導以為灼炟也。","annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line073:m0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"導","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line073:m0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"劉遐","kind":"person","person_id":"1eg_4i2_q9u","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line073:m0088","start":88,"end":89,"surface":"導","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":73,"last_line":73,"revision_id":2614273},"source_quote":{"witness":"j98","quote":"夫福如反手，用之即是。導所統六軍，石頭萬五千人，宮內後苑二萬人，護軍屯金城六千人，劉遐已至，征北昨已濟江萬五千人。以天子之威，文武畢力，豈可當乎！事猶可追，兄早思之。大兵一奪，導以為灼炟也。","raw_start":6299,"raw_end":6394,"raw_line":73},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-006-jin098-shenchong","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-006","source_id":"s-jinshu-006-jin098-shenchong","source":{"title":"晉書明帝紀","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2674431","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2674431","revision_id":2674431,"accessed_on":"2026-10-18","extent":"下列來源節錄。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄；保留見證歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"固定修訂相關原文，逐字核收。","wikitext_sha256":"4bcc7edd878f1baecc9a21f26128556c303b980fd5e43f0a1ec988c3a046b929","raw_path":"source-evidence/jin065-wangdao-main/external/jin006-ws2674431.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"4bcc7edd878f1baecc9a21f26128556c303b980fd5e43f0a1ec988c3a046b929"}},{"chapter_id